# Shared packages

| Package | Import | Purpose |
|---------|--------|---------|
| `@hirevault/types` | `packages/types` | DB + API TypeScript types |
| `@hirevault/ai-core` | `packages/ai-core` | Zod schemas, JD parse, bullet rewrite, ATS heuristic, interview gen |
| `@hirevault/resume-templates` | `packages/resume-templates` | LaTeX build + `pdflatex` PDF render |
| `@hirevault/orchestrator` | `packages/orchestrator` | Archived agent build loop — not product runtime |

## ai-core modules

- `schemas.ts` — `ResumeContent`, parsed JD types (export types from here, not from `"use server"` files)
- `parse.ts` — OpenAI JD parsing
- `write.ts` — Anthropic bullet rewrites
- `resume.ts` — experience scoring, keyword match
- `interviews.ts` — question generation

Web app calls these from `lib/resumes/actions.ts`, `lib/interviews/actions.ts`, `lib/ingestion/`.

## Resume PDF

LaTeX only (`packages/resume-templates`). Requires `pdflatex` on host (`LATEX_COMPILER` env optional). No HTML/Chromium PDF path.

## Tests

Package-level unit tests live beside source (`*.test.ts`). Run via root `pnpm test` (turbo).
